しくお願いします」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59284"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d78dcfae37d340ba89982cf718adeec651f47d2fdf9c54ad8950273e04104926.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8b079aa0cbea436a9414eb44658138ccdf9419b242c4b4fd9ea8a6bd801340d7.webp","width":132,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"米澤円","creatorId":"vndb:s189","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s189","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s189","name":"米澤 円","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:230424:59284:5117:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c66241","characterName":"宮森 ゆず","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59285","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"230424"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18430"],"vndbCharacterId":"c66241"},"originalCharacterName":"宮森 ゆず","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The only girl who's building up a relationship with Ryouichi at the point the story starts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves sweets and wants to become a patisserie herself. Still, she's careful not to eat too much in order to maintain her figure."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Wanting Ryouichi to eat her sweets and compliment her that it's tasty, ever since the two were together in the home economics club she has been making him taste every new sweet to taste (it's been continuing for three years already, and has become natural for both)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she's usually quiet girl, she turns into a completely different, active person when she's cooking."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c66241"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語開始時点で唯一、諒一との関係が構築されている女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お菓子大好きで、かねてよりパティシエールになりたいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、スタイルを維持するため、食べすぎないように気をつけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"諒一に食べてもらいたい、美味しいと言ってほしいという思いで、家庭科部時代から、新作ができたら諒一に食べさせるのが習慣化している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（３年くらい続いていて、お互い疑問に思わなくなっている）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、いつもはおっとりしているのに、料理の時は人が変わったようにテキパキとこなしていく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18430","sourceWorkId":"26119","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語開始時点で唯一、諒一との関係が構築されている女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お菓子大好きで、かねてよりパティシエールになりたいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、スタイルを維持するため、食べすぎないように気をつけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"諒一に食べてもらいたい、美味しいと言ってほしいという思いで、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家庭科部時代から、新作ができたら諒一に食べさせるのが習慣化している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（3年くらい続いていて、お互い疑問に思わなくなっている）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、いつもはおっとりしているのに、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"料理の時は人が変わったようにテキパキとこなしていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「調理部はいつでも体験ＯＫ、新入部員募集中だよー」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59285"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af42ff7d2a261be39b4440cb1748a9d2afb3a52d50d2e6978b701b927abeba22.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76d34f44d307839698fe9b4332e2fcc1660c80ed1d79e07f5e3973b769d2bf0b.webp","width":132,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三宅麻理恵","creatorId":"vndb:s2258","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2258","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2258","name":"三宅 麻理恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:230424:59285:6846:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c66242","characterName":"神楽 楓","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59286","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"230424"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18431"],"vndbCharacterId":"c66242"},"originalCharacterName":"神楽 楓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"55"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"48"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A senpai thought by the surroundings to be a cool person and feared a little. She is a former member of the school athletics club and was known to have been one of the best of her time. As a result, she is now taller, more muscular and stronger than an average girl. Ryouichi even thinks she's probably stronger than him. Despite this body that Kaede describes as \"not really feminine\" she is seen and considered as one of the most beautiful girls in the school by all students."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She hates boasting of talents and hard work and people who do that, and doesn't acknowledge that of her own. Moreover, she doesn't boast of her own pretty looks. However, she doesn't disparage herself, it's just that she doesn't appeal her own good points."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Also, she doesn't believe in ANY fortunetelling, the reason for that is because \"I'm easy to trick\", she says. Similarly to the fortunetelling, she can be easily deceived by a well thought up story. Basically, she's quite simple a person."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c66242"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"周りからはクールだと思われており、若干怖がられている面もある先輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"才能的な部分や、努力の部分を自慢することや人があまり好きではなく、自分の長所を長所と思っていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、容姿も綺麗だが、自慢してきたりはしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、卑屈な感じではなく、アピールポイントをアピールしない感じ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、占いなどを一切信じていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その理由が「私…騙されやすすぎるから」というもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"占いもそうだが、そこそこ筋の通っている話だところっと騙されてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんなチョロさも持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18431","sourceWorkId":"26119","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"周りからはクールだと思われており、若干怖がられている面もある先輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"才能的な部分や、努力の部分を自慢することや人があまり好きではなく、自分の長所を長所と思っていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、容姿も綺麗だが、自慢してきたりはしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、卑屈な感じではなく、アピールポイントをアピールしない感じ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、占いなどを一切信じていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その理由が「私…騙されやすすぎるから」というもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"占いもそうだが、そこそこ筋の通っている話だところっと騙されてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんなチョロさも持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……あれ？　私、先輩って言ったっけ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59286"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/4527e2e44287fbfbda55c5fdb177ff49aab0bcaf583c7b37162c6fcd498e1b3f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a75330acf4c06b65dadd3d4f8a8444a943fbee43d22331ab2ff91f949cc4118d.webp","width":132,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"前田恵","creatorId":"vndb:s11","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11","name":"前田 恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:230424:59286:8580:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c66243","characterName":"秋月 つづり","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59287","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"230424"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18432"],"vndbCharacterId":"c66243"},"originalCharacterName":"秋月 つづり","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"150"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"46"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A well-mannered junior who's really into inter-human relations. While she's refined, she isn't too stiff and with her gentle demeanor she's capable of putting others on the pedestal."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For some reason she comes to respect Ryouichi and honestly responds with \"well well\" \"oh my\" \"I see\" to everything he teaches her, making it fun for him to teach her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tsuzuri is very intellectual and doesn't allow her pace to crumble. Capable of making do with others and her own pace, it could be said that she applies her human-relations skill to her own heart as well."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c66243"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"礼儀のしっかりした、コミュ力全開の後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"硬すぎない品の良さを持っており、物腰の柔らかさと相手の持ち上げ方がうまい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なぜか諒一のことを尊敬しており、よく付いて回る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"諒一が教えた些細なことなどに「まあ」「あら」「なるほど」と素直に感動し、教えるのが楽しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理知的で自分のペースを崩さない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他人とも、自分ともうまくやってきて、言うなれば自分の心に対してもコミュ力を発揮している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18432","sourceWorkId":"26119","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"礼儀のしっかりした、コミュ力全開の後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"硬すぎない品の良さを持っており、物腰の柔らかさと相手の持ち上げ方がうまい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なぜか諒一のことを尊敬しており、よく付いて回る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"諒一が教えた些細なことなどに「まあ」「あら」「なるほど」と素直に感動し、教えるのが楽しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理知的で自分のペースを崩さない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他人とも、自分ともうまくやってきて、言うなれば自分の心に対してもコミュ力を発揮している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「おはようございます！　今日も1日、頑張りましょうっ♪」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59287"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3fc074242ef633f30a4539a115ff92372d880e80e92161195132f27e415589d1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e1bc4025e68ced259233f26bc53745f08b1a8afe59e14d7b9a21b64149281471.webp","width":132,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"谷口夢奈","creatorId":"vndb:s14335","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14335","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14335","name":"谷口 夢奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:230424:59287:29570:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c66244","characterName":"織原 諒一","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c66244"},"originalCharacterName":"織原 諒一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"173"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"64"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist who has a very kind personality and cannot overlook anyone in trouble, if he ever does he would continue to be bothered about it and end up helping out anyway. He supports his best friend, a little too serious and inflexible class president, from the shadows."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although he is fairly sharp when it comes to the human relations and love relations of people around him, he is completely blind when it comes to such feelings aimed in his direction."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His mother is running a dressmaking classroom and a shop with dressmaking goods, influenced by that he has been \"beat\" sewing into him ever since he's been young, but doesn't hate it. He enjoys changing materials into something completely different, similarly to how people enjoy cooking."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c66244"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/133e8f84f005cc6d8b292f648a8e3d336d7b3c23c3896514b33989310b0b6609.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/50c80f051e0b0566a16430939815423d044671d0630b13aadc72aa413438cc59.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69115","characterName":"春河 陽菜子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69115"},"originalCharacterName":"春河 陽菜子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"147"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"38"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A very easy to understand tsundere. Even when she's using abusive language towards others, her feelings of happiness easily appear on her face."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"You'll be left behind by the world\" she says, and worried about Tsuzuri who doesn't use SNS, she meddles in."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's in a junior-senior relationship with Yuzu in the cooking club. She respects Yuzu for making sweets as good or even better than pros, but often is very anxious about Yuzu who can act in dangerous manner."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69115"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/053bec6b52382976078640f365590a5b6e58ffb693a94354021d09d8b50ef576.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/901681b646f19650f745d9fc3ab59aadc7d412ea91bad046f1ef420fddd834e7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松手 多代","creatorId":"vndb:s7954","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7954","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7954","name":"木村 珠莉","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:76294","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69116","characterName":"岩出 清貴","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69116"},"originalCharacterName":"岩出 清貴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A friend of Ryouichi's ever since they have become classmates last year. Considering Ryouchi a good friend, he cheers him on and often gives a him advice from a third person's perspective."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kiyotaka is inflexible, simple, and too honest. Once he decides on something he enters tunnel vision and is unable to change his actions. But, in such cases a logic-founded advice does work."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's so serious that he turns off his phone during classes, but he acts unexpectedly flexible towards others."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69116"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/16aa3f0f3ffc2729031691e583c989b9dd002047df5b37c130f27328d854792c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b9ee706ba13aecc785704d32df6ce3cf0db6cfcfcbc85963ecac659e87486c93.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"林寄華麗","creatorId":"vndb:s16200","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s16200","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s16200","name":"林寄華麗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:76297","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69144","characterName":"小野寺 いちか","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69144"},"originalCharacterName":"小野寺 いちか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"50"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who acts with a strong momentum and clearly displays her mood, she's complete opposite of Yuzu and the two's friend relationship fill each other's weaknesses."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has been best friends with Yuzu ever since the previous school. Although she has many friends, she's especially close with Yuzu and is aware that Yuzu has feelings for Ryouichi."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69144"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a35e5303669b214fc46437c486730e7acbf59b719521522d5cf73c01e9d822f4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/39553c897058a3f09bc3b93848385fddac495865b875a1043fe38fce0b4a40d2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山田巴奈子","creatorId":"vndb:s16199","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s16199","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s16199","name":"山田巴奈子","roleCode":"voice-actor","